    "flavor_text": {
      "one_line": "Khordurn — wary clan confederation of the mountains (not glacial/volcanic); honor, tradition.",
      "one_paragraph": "The Khordurn (Dwarf) are a defensive clan confederation people seeded in mountains (not glacial/volcanic). They prize honor, tradition, wealth, lean toward the military sphere, and field heavy_infantry, crossbowmen, pikemen. Outsiders are met as wary; their patrons touch mountains, war, trade."
